				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			) <i>spur, prick with a spur</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					10.1
