			,<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Palaeph.
				52
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>spur on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					20.12.2
				</span></i>
			; of athletes, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμναστέοι συντόνως
				μυωπιζόμενοι</span> cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Gym.</u>
				42
			</span></i>; <i>to be stimulated</i>, 
